# Line endings.
#
# Windows checkouts here run with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every
# text file to CRLF on checkout. That is harmless for the pane (Vite and
# Node tolerate CRLF) but fatal for anything shipped to the droplet as-is:
# a bash script whose first line ends in \r dies with "set: pipefail:
# invalid option name", and systemd rejects unit lines it cannot parse.
# 2026-09-10: the model-catalog install silently no-op'd for exactly this
# reason. Pin everything that leaves this machine to LF.
apps/excel-addin/server/**  text eol=lf
*.sh                        text eol=lf
*.service                   text eol=lf
*.timer                     text eol=lf
*.conf                      text eol=lf
